        "created_at": "2017-03-29T02:13:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Hooray! The official unlock conditions for Termi-Nation Unity have been discovered by the community.</span><br><br><b>In a game with regular Unity on the team, more than 5 times (H) hero targets must be in play for a complete round (from the start of the villain turn through the end of the environment turn). Only hero targets that have HP printed on their card count.</b></p>",
