        "created_at": "2017-03-30T00:37:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Did as suggested, went to Mars to fight Ambuscade with Captain Cosmic and RC Wraith in tow. I had AA instead of Wraith for a while, but then after trying to get an early Meteor Storm a few times I just decided to swap him out. Of course that try was when the storm decided to be the very first enviro card. :/ She was still useful though, helping the team avoid the Pervasive Red Dust or Countdown when she could. It was slow going, but after building up enough bots and constructs it all went pretty well.</p><p>![](upload://tNiEBygqyhQJBq0LAqy7slpDm24.jpeg)</p>",
