        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"NinjaMonkey\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> NinjaMonkey:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mars is nice. I went the Realm of Discord route for Imbued Vitality</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I thought, from the \"Hp must be printed on the card\" disclaimer, Imbued Vitality wouldn't count toward the total.</p>",
