        "created_at": "2017-04-02T00:40:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Team Leader Tachyon, Cosmic, Unity, Argent Adept, and Grandpa Legacy versus Ambuscade at Wagner worked really well. Takes longer because of the number of heroes, but all the out of turn draws, plays, and powers really speeds things up. Also got a Meteor storm first round, which really helped out.</p>",
